{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e79c4f3f24d138a39fd1653027b09983d87c7abd402a23c85852f2ff50f45939", "ja": "お、真美。さっそく着てるな。\n……うん、すごく可愛いじゃないか！", "zh": "哦，真美。已经这么快就穿上了啊。\n……嗯，真的很可爱嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "d28bde06b37abf7e1c4f2fbccf067eac2aa7731429fc5645ce3e715255276aaa", "ja": "むむっ、兄ちゃん評論家くん、それはホントかね？\nホントのホントに、カワイイと思ってるのかね！？", "zh": "唔唔，老哥评论家，那是真的吗？\n你真的真的，觉得很可爱吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dda6252b0beb2e41f0cfaa6c1e13a29df5dd03d5ce1fa996c0a37ac7081ecc28", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ、真美？\nずいぶん疑ってかかるな。", "zh": "怎、怎么了，真美？\n你怎么这么怀疑啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "152594b84cea9bd27c3390e14dac68d327b13447c022be20c2cc976d566bc7c9", "ja": "それがさ、聞いてよ兄ちゃん……。\n真美、イヤ～な夢、見ちゃったんだよね～。", "zh": "那个啊，听我说，哥哥……  \n真美做了个好～讨厌的梦呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "c6a9c5121202e8c9356b955cedc4cd64e85017aed45ea535df044cc0e6ddd1fb", "ja": "この衣装を着た真美が、ステージで失敗しちゃうの。\nうあうあ～、不吉だよ～！　マサムネになるかもだよ！", "zh": "穿着这套服装的真美，在舞台上失败了。  \n呜啊呜啊～好不吉利啊～！说不定会变成“真美梦”哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2013f075984054c2786b334cc3b6229b81b89f063d55418fd3832b745aaf3ee2", "ja": "マサムネ……正夢か？\nさすがにそれは考えすぎじゃないか？", "zh": "政宗……是预知梦吗？\n这未免也想太多了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "1d8c6e00678f7a3d0ec6a7105e9d8ca2cde00aaf3944b939df617e58ef2f435c", "ja": "そんなことない！　ねえねえ兄ちゃん、真美のこと\nほめてほめて、ほめまくって！　自信プリーズ！", "zh": "才不是那样！呐呐，哥哥，快夸夸真美，\n使劲夸我！请给我自信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1007_p", "source_sha256": "54fb526276273eec0126e740139effc045786bbfa51d1c5b1b1a264ac2ba608c", "ja": "仕方ないな……。それじゃあ……真美、\nその衣装、すごく似合ってるぞ！　メチャカワだ！", "zh": "真拿你没办法……那就……真美，你这身服装非常适合你！超级可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "4140b67eb80be1f1867b9ff84dee0ab92804039a6b2e4c8a7a718c4e48198e10", "ja": "うんうん！　それから、それから？", "zh": "嗯嗯！然后呢，然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "81b22dd114102b97a10b29abc8017a76323a85952ae74326e7afebaec27121db", "ja": "真美はステージパフォーマンスだって最高だ！\nファンも釘付けになること間違いなしだぞ！", "zh": "真美的舞台表演也棒极了！  \n粉丝们肯定会看得目不转睛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "cd3775f01198716989c46f5b88d0d280f1d494d1e55f3b3768e5283f77427ed1", "ja": "よっ、ほめ上手！　兄ちゃんにそう言われたら、\n本当にうまくできそうな気がしてきたよ！", "zh": "哟，真会夸人！被大哥你这么一说，\n真美都觉得真的能表现得很棒了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "03b8be8ac0d82ede87081c8cdb066dd0e70d2ba7d259bf05ae7d20e9021c3450", "ja": "はぁ～、なんかホッとしたかも。\nありがとね、兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "哈啊～感觉好像放心多了。\n谢谢你啦，哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6b39ca1ee216dc1b1123634dc473a45c1037aa481227fa573d8b28562b9eb6d2", "ja": "はは、それはよかった。にしても意外だな。\n真美はそういう夢とか、気にしないと思ってたよ。", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。不过还真让人意外啊。我本来以为真美不会在意那种梦想之类的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "f43f78c144736076d5cc5d3bc558bac8b49e42a64a6d7ffcfe32e48f835c61d5", "ja": "ちっちっち、まだまだ修行が足りないね兄ちゃん。\n真美だって、センサイな乙女なのだよ。", "zh": "啧啧啧，哥哥还差得远呢。真美也是纤细的少女哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6ba9a8f156c72ba3b8a8241775174321189bd5b42f59e9198f3910bfd6cad6de", "ja": "そ、そうだよな。\nすまん、茶化して悪かった。", "zh": "对、对啊。\n抱歉，不该拿你开玩笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "80c4dbf3b2874aead16510f73b59b60d00846f67ee1cd444db9b297d5bc0ddfd", "ja": "わかればよろしい。\nこれからも真美のこと、いっぱいほめるように！", "zh": "明白了就好。\n今后也要多多夸奖真美哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2e489d4fdb0f74402851281d77fb1f871af4953b1e47412b338327e0471af758", "ja": "気を付けるよ。それじゃあ、お詫びも兼ねて、\nもうしばらく真美と話をしていこうかな。", "zh": "我会注意的。那么，就当作赔礼，再和真美聊一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
