{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "308cc7f2f0a9e1027ce8aed3cc502f35409dbc06580d5405b41120d6fe9b41ea", "ja": "おお……！　さすが、真美の兄ちゃん♪\n真美のよろこぶツボをしっかりガッチリ押さえてるね♪", "zh": "哦哦……！不愧是真美的哥哥♪  \n牢牢抓住了让真美开心的诀窍呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0354_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "d216dd1f5f6684c0ce0bc6d84bd5752ce00b71a05834a58c65ad62fed7039274", "ja": "そんじゃエンリョなく、兄ちゃんの甘々攻撃を受けると\nしようかな！　さあさあ、いつでもバッチこいだよ！", "zh": "那我就不客气地接下哥哥的甜蜜攻击啦！来吧来吧，随时放马过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
